WEBVTT

00:41.333 --> 00:43.961
NO TAIL TO TELL

00:52.469 --> 00:54.304
This isn't happening, Si-yeol.

00:54.388 --> 00:57.224
I know. I saw it all,
and you're not going to die.

00:57.307 --> 01:02.563
So stop making me worry
and please wake up, okay?

01:03.397 --> 01:04.648
Patient's BP is dropping.

01:06.984 --> 01:09.236
No, Si-yeol.

01:10.487 --> 01:12.239
Please, save him.

01:12.322 --> 01:14.825
I'll do anything, so please.

01:14.908 --> 01:16.535
Please.

01:16.618 --> 01:18.870
I don't know what to do.

01:19.913 --> 01:21.164
Si-yeol.

01:21.832 --> 01:22.958
No…

01:23.625 --> 01:25.460
Please, no.

01:26.003 --> 01:27.337
You can't come in.

01:52.613 --> 01:56.325
EPISODE 12
LOVE WITHOUT REGRET

01:56.408 --> 01:58.994
WOOSONG HOSPITAL

02:06.627 --> 02:08.211
What is this?

02:09.755 --> 02:10.881
It's a fox bead.

02:11.798 --> 02:12.758
Pardon?

02:12.841 --> 02:16.011
You said the male shaman is after this.

02:17.763 --> 02:21.725
It could be taken from me,
so I need you to keep it safe for a while.

02:24.311 --> 02:27.814
But is it really okay for me
to hold on to this?

02:29.232 --> 02:31.109
It shouldn't be dangerous,

02:31.818 --> 02:33.862
as long as you don't open it.

02:35.906 --> 02:38.408
It might look like
just an ordinary wooden box,

02:38.492 --> 02:41.953
but an eight-tailed fox used her last bit
of spiritual power to seal it.

02:42.704 --> 02:44.665
So that pathetic male shaman

02:45.540 --> 02:48.960
won't be able to find the bead's energy,
let alone the eight-tailed fox herself.

02:49.461 --> 02:51.338
No, that's not what I mean.

02:51.421 --> 02:53.965
Is it okay to trust me
with something this important?

02:55.467 --> 02:56.760
Why not?

02:57.552 --> 02:59.054
Well, because…

03:00.639 --> 03:01.932
you know everything.

03:06.561 --> 03:08.522
You know what kind of person I am,

03:09.398 --> 03:12.150
what I'm really like deep down.

03:13.860 --> 03:15.195
Don't flatter yourself.

03:15.696 --> 03:18.115
You're not that special.

03:18.740 --> 03:21.076
Do you think it's easy to be a bad guy?

03:21.618 --> 03:25.706
I don't believe
humans are particularly good,

03:25.789 --> 03:30.544
but I don't think
they're purely wicked or selfish either.

03:32.045 --> 03:34.297
Even if you have an ugly side deep down,

03:34.923 --> 03:37.217
I'm sure that's not all there is to you.

03:40.679 --> 03:42.597
Honestly, I don't know.

03:42.681 --> 03:44.141
At first,

03:44.933 --> 03:47.519
I didn't think
I was such a bad guy either.

03:48.478 --> 03:51.022
But at some point,

03:51.106 --> 03:53.442
- I realized I'd become so--
- You became pathetic.

03:54.526 --> 03:56.111
That's just how it is.

03:56.194 --> 04:00.991
If you live life showing your worst side,
you'll only sink lower and lower.

04:05.370 --> 04:06.580
Don't worry about this.

04:07.205 --> 04:08.665
I'll keep it safe.

04:09.374 --> 04:15.380
But is there really a way for me
and Si-yeol to get our lives back?

04:16.006 --> 04:17.841
Don't worry. Just focus on getting better.

04:17.924 --> 04:20.218
If you die before I can do anything,

04:20.969 --> 04:23.930
then there really won't be
any way to fix this.

04:25.182 --> 04:26.558
What's that?

04:27.809 --> 04:30.187
Oh, it's nothing.

04:31.772 --> 04:33.064
Aren't you bored?

04:34.733 --> 04:36.026
Why don't you watch some TV?

04:36.985 --> 04:40.906
The gunshot victim was transported
to a nearby university hospital.

04:40.989 --> 04:43.325
Police have identified Lee,
a man in his thirties,

04:43.408 --> 04:46.453
as the prime suspect and are in pursuit.

04:46.536 --> 04:51.082
Lee, who was imprisoned nine years ago
for various crimes,

04:51.166 --> 04:53.376
is believed to be
the fourth-generation heir to G Group.

04:53.460 --> 04:56.338
He allegedly committed this act of revenge
immediately after his release,

04:56.421 --> 04:57.714
shocking the public.

05:01.468 --> 05:02.594
Kelly.

05:06.348 --> 05:07.599
Sponge stick.

05:08.767 --> 05:10.435
- Tie, please.
- Yes, Doctor.

05:23.865 --> 05:25.158
How did it go?

05:26.701 --> 05:28.370
We did our best,

05:28.453 --> 05:31.498
but he was already
bleeding heavily before the surgery,

05:31.581 --> 05:34.543
and the organ damage was too extensive.

05:35.585 --> 05:38.713
I think you should prepare for the worst.

05:45.470 --> 05:49.307
He may not make it through the night.

05:53.270 --> 05:57.315
Wake up. This isn't funny at all.

06:00.694 --> 06:01.945
Why did you…

06:02.612 --> 06:04.447
Because of me…

06:06.074 --> 06:07.409
Si-yeol.

06:07.951 --> 06:10.453
I've never been through
something like this before.

06:10.537 --> 06:12.581
I don't know what to do.

06:14.332 --> 06:16.376
What am I supposed to do?

06:18.920 --> 06:20.046
I'd rather…

06:22.132 --> 06:24.801
I'd rather take the punishment myself.

06:24.885 --> 06:28.805
That's what you guys really want.

06:28.889 --> 06:31.474
Si-yeol didn't do anything wrong.

06:34.519 --> 06:36.438
What do I have to do…

06:36.521 --> 06:37.814
What can I do…

06:46.823 --> 06:49.659
There will come a time
when you must choose.

06:49.743 --> 06:51.828
Whether to become human

06:52.662 --> 06:55.957
or be forever annihilated.

07:06.509 --> 07:07.928
Si-yeol.

07:09.638 --> 07:11.139
What happened?

07:23.902 --> 07:25.403
Hold on.

07:25.487 --> 07:26.821
Where exactly are we going?

07:26.905 --> 07:29.115
I followed you because you told me to,

07:29.199 --> 07:30.742
- but why are we here--
- It's just…

07:31.451 --> 07:33.536
This place holds special meaning for me.

07:35.163 --> 07:37.290
I should at least get to choose the spot

07:37.374 --> 07:38.959
for my final moment.

07:41.586 --> 07:43.171
Are you serious right now?

07:43.254 --> 07:46.216
You said
Si-yeol might not survive the night.

07:52.764 --> 07:53.890
Okay, look.

07:55.016 --> 07:58.269
What about that other nine-tailed fox?
I mean, was it the eight-tailed fox?

07:58.353 --> 08:00.271
Can't she do something to help?

08:00.897 --> 08:01.898
She can't.

08:01.982 --> 08:05.902
Saving a dying person
is more than she can handle.

08:05.986 --> 08:10.573
Then are you telling me
to just stand by and watch Si-yeol die?

08:13.076 --> 08:15.328
There's only one way.

08:17.205 --> 08:18.665
But…

08:20.125 --> 08:22.002
I need your help.

08:27.716 --> 08:28.800
How?

08:39.644 --> 08:42.063
This is the Sajin Ritual Blade.

08:43.690 --> 08:47.527
It holds the sacred power
to sever and defy fate.

08:49.487 --> 08:52.407
Well, what am I supposed to do with it?

08:55.160 --> 08:56.411
Stab me with it.

08:59.205 --> 09:00.081
What?

09:01.041 --> 09:02.125
I said, stab me.

09:02.959 --> 09:05.545
Then I will vanish
from this world entirely,

09:06.379 --> 09:09.340
and everything that was twisted
and distorted because of me

09:10.050 --> 09:11.718
will go back to the way it was.

09:12.427 --> 09:13.803
Then Si-yeol…

09:17.098 --> 09:19.142
won't have to die in vain like this.

09:24.314 --> 09:25.899
But still…

09:28.735 --> 09:30.445
We don't have time to hesitate.

09:30.528 --> 09:33.782
If Si-yeol just dies like this,

09:33.865 --> 09:36.159
then there's really nothing we can do.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.579
And that means you'll die as well.

09:58.264 --> 10:01.226
This is the end for me. My final moment.

10:03.061 --> 10:07.107
I never once imagined an ending like this.

10:28.169 --> 10:29.921
But Geum-ho,

10:30.004 --> 10:32.215
I think I finally understand
your final words.

10:32.298 --> 10:34.217
The ones I spent a lifetime
trying to grasp

10:34.300 --> 10:36.469
and could never make sense of

10:37.554 --> 10:39.556
until this moment.

10:41.641 --> 10:45.270
My end isn't what I wanted it to be,

10:46.479 --> 10:49.732
and my last moment may be tragic.

10:53.945 --> 10:55.780
But even so…

10:58.199 --> 11:01.619
I lived my own life, just like you did.

11:07.041 --> 11:08.334
With no regrets.

12:36.339 --> 12:38.841
So this is how it ends after all.

12:47.934 --> 12:48.977
Eun-ho.

13:00.655 --> 13:02.824
Eun-ho!

13:05.410 --> 13:08.288
Did I really do this…

13:08.997 --> 13:10.290
It's not like that.

13:11.582 --> 13:12.875
I chose this.

13:14.669 --> 13:16.004
Just hold on.

13:16.087 --> 13:17.839
I'll go get help--

13:17.922 --> 13:19.465
Don't go.

13:19.549 --> 13:21.843
Stay with me.

13:24.679 --> 13:27.056
I don't have much time left.

13:29.142 --> 13:31.686
Why did you do this?

13:33.104 --> 13:35.898
You said you'd choose
the solution for both of us.

13:37.608 --> 13:39.068
But this isn't it.

13:42.280 --> 13:44.115
Once I'm gone,

13:45.241 --> 13:47.535
I can't really imagine

13:48.244 --> 13:50.496
what that world will look like.

13:52.915 --> 13:55.168
But at least I can save you

13:56.252 --> 13:59.464
and give you your life back.

14:01.924 --> 14:04.093
None of that matters to me anymore.

14:05.511 --> 14:07.263
I just want to be with you

14:07.930 --> 14:09.515
and live a normal life.

14:10.892 --> 14:12.393
Even if I have nothing,

14:12.977 --> 14:16.022
I just want us to be together, okay?

14:17.065 --> 14:18.816
So please don't die.

14:19.484 --> 14:20.943
Don't leave me like this.

14:26.491 --> 14:29.744
Si-yeol, do you remember

14:31.079 --> 14:32.747
the bet we made?

14:34.165 --> 14:37.293
You said you'd grant me a wish.

14:38.127 --> 14:41.047
Yeah. I remember.

14:42.131 --> 14:44.258
Once everything went back to normal,

14:45.426 --> 14:48.262
I was going to erase your memory.

14:50.056 --> 14:52.475
So you wouldn't be in pain

14:54.102 --> 14:55.937
or miss me.

14:57.355 --> 15:00.733
So you could live a normal, happy life,

15:01.984 --> 15:04.987
just like before.

15:06.781 --> 15:09.325
But I don't have that power anymore.

15:10.827 --> 15:13.621
Eun-ho… please don't.

15:13.704 --> 15:14.789
Eun-ho.

15:14.872 --> 15:17.417
So please forget me.

15:19.085 --> 15:20.795
That's my wish.

15:27.009 --> 15:29.345
Eun-ho, no!

15:29.429 --> 15:32.056
No… Eun-ho!

15:33.015 --> 15:34.267
Eun-ho…

15:41.357 --> 15:44.068
I really wasn't going to say this.

15:45.236 --> 15:47.238
I know I shouldn't…

15:49.615 --> 15:51.868
so forget what I'm about to say too.

15:54.036 --> 15:55.580
I love you, Si-yeol.

16:16.976 --> 16:18.311
Eun-ho…

16:19.437 --> 16:20.855
Eun-ho!

16:29.280 --> 16:31.324
Eun-ho!

16:35.244 --> 16:37.663
RIVER OF THREE CROSSINGS

16:58.351 --> 17:01.187
As you can see,
the boat isn't running today.

17:02.480 --> 17:05.399
I don't know whose temper is so damn foul,

17:05.483 --> 17:06.817
but I've never seen

17:06.901 --> 17:09.779
the River of Three Crossings
rage like this.

17:19.121 --> 17:22.083
The test results aren't good.

17:22.166 --> 17:23.125
At this rate,

17:23.834 --> 17:26.629
I don't think you'll make it
through the year.

17:26.712 --> 17:29.632
I think it would be best
to prepare yourself.

17:32.009 --> 17:33.302
I understand.

17:34.845 --> 17:36.055
What is it?

17:38.182 --> 17:39.141
Well…

17:39.809 --> 17:42.395
I think Mr. Kang's chart got mixed up.

17:43.104 --> 17:44.188
What?

17:46.357 --> 17:47.984
Wait, how did this…

17:52.280 --> 17:54.699
The scan is clean.
There's nothing wrong with you.

17:54.782 --> 17:56.867
You must have been terrified.

17:56.951 --> 17:57.952
I am so sorry.

17:58.035 --> 18:00.955
This never happens. I don't know how…

18:01.038 --> 18:02.540
I really am sorry.

19:00.139 --> 19:04.018
What good does carrying
all that weight do?

19:04.101 --> 19:07.313
It's heavy enough
to sink a ship, you fool.

19:08.022 --> 19:10.399
Who are you trying to drag down with you?

19:13.986 --> 19:16.656
Drink up and forget all about it.

19:17.990 --> 19:20.159
Why are you so attached to this life?

19:41.639 --> 19:44.016
That day, one life ended…

19:44.100 --> 19:45.309
ONE YEAR LATER

19:45.393 --> 19:47.144
…and several seasons passed.

19:48.396 --> 19:51.273
Kang Si-yeol, currently playing
in the English second division,

19:51.357 --> 19:57.029
scored a dramatic winning goal,
leading Thames FC to automatic promotion.

19:57.113 --> 20:00.032
Turning down transfer offers
from the world's top clubs,

20:00.116 --> 20:05.913
he stayed with his relegated team
and showed true dedication as captain.

20:05.996 --> 20:07.373
Just as he promised,

20:07.456 --> 20:11.043
he secured the team's early promotion
in just one season,

20:11.127 --> 20:13.295
making a glorious return
to the Premier League.

20:13.379 --> 20:17.174
I think this match
showed everyone who we are.

20:17.842 --> 20:19.593
We had tougher moments, but…

20:21.178 --> 20:23.055
In that place where life ended,

20:23.139 --> 20:26.809
everything that was twisted and distorted
returned back to normal.

20:27.393 --> 20:30.146
The human world just went on
as if nothing had happened.

20:37.695 --> 20:40.531
Some regained what they had lost.

20:44.702 --> 20:47.037
They grew older
yet remained free of illness.

20:55.671 --> 20:57.965
Some never died…

21:00.843 --> 21:02.845
- and some never grieved.
- Dad!

21:02.928 --> 21:04.013
Honey!

21:04.096 --> 21:05.848
Did you miss me?

21:05.931 --> 21:07.641
- Wait, Dad. That's not important.
- What?

21:07.725 --> 21:09.852
Do you know who I just saw at the airport?

21:09.935 --> 21:12.563
Kang Si-yeol! I got his autograph!

21:12.646 --> 21:15.149
Kang Si-yeol? What?

21:15.232 --> 21:17.234
Did you get it made out to me?

21:17.818 --> 21:19.570
Hey, you don't even like soccer.

21:19.653 --> 21:22.531
I may not like soccer,
but I like Kang Si-yeol.

21:25.576 --> 21:27.077
TO HYE-RIM, I HOPE YOU'RE HAPPY

21:27.161 --> 21:31.207
But come to think of it,
I don't think I told him my name.

21:31.290 --> 21:34.710
You've got your name plastered
right on your suitcase.

21:34.794 --> 21:38.714
How else would Kang Si-yeol know
my daughter's name?

21:38.798 --> 21:39.715
- Seriously.
- However,

21:39.799 --> 21:42.510
even if it seemed
as if nothing had happened,

21:43.177 --> 21:45.596
it doesn't mean it wasn't real.

21:45.679 --> 21:48.390
You know that student from the airport?

21:49.099 --> 21:50.100
What?

21:50.184 --> 21:52.186
You just seemed really happy to see her.

21:52.269 --> 21:55.773
Right, you wouldn't remember.

21:56.732 --> 21:57.733
What?

21:57.817 --> 21:59.276
Do I know her too?

22:01.028 --> 22:02.112
No.

22:03.656 --> 22:05.866
Anyway, you've been weird lately.

22:05.950 --> 22:09.912
You rarely smile,
and you don't seem to care about anything.

22:10.496 --> 22:14.750
You don't even seem that happy
about finishing this season so well.

23:22.735 --> 23:26.780
Your world is truly chaotic.

23:32.995 --> 23:36.457
Isn't it time you let it go?

24:07.196 --> 24:09.615
NINE YEARS LATER

24:10.532 --> 24:11.867
H PUB

24:18.290 --> 24:20.292
We're closed for the night.

24:21.168 --> 24:22.544
Hello, Mr. Hyeon.

24:23.796 --> 24:24.713
It's you, Si-yeol.

24:25.547 --> 24:26.674
Come in.

24:27.758 --> 24:29.134
Where's Woo-seok?

24:29.218 --> 24:30.094
Hey.

24:33.722 --> 24:36.767
Ordering pizza at this hour? That's new.

24:36.850 --> 24:39.561
I haven't told anyone this yet,

24:40.354 --> 24:41.355
but I'm retiring.

24:43.273 --> 24:46.068
Well, good for you.

24:46.151 --> 24:49.113
Considering your age,
you should've done it long ago.

24:49.613 --> 24:51.448
You've milked it long enough.

24:51.532 --> 24:52.700
Right?

24:56.036 --> 24:57.997
So what now? Are you going to be a coach?

24:58.747 --> 25:00.499
I'm done with soccer,

25:01.000 --> 25:02.668
so I'll take my time figuring that out.

25:04.670 --> 25:06.630
Anyway, how's this place doing?

25:06.714 --> 25:08.424
Ever thought about opening
a second branch?

25:08.507 --> 25:10.300
You? Running a business?

25:10.968 --> 25:12.928
Making a living is no joke.

25:13.512 --> 25:15.639
You look pretty happy, considering.

25:16.473 --> 25:19.268
Well, once I actually started,

25:19.351 --> 25:22.312
it really suited me.
Cooking's kind of fun too.

25:33.282 --> 25:35.409
You know, when our fates switched back…

25:36.160 --> 25:37.703
Has it already been ten years?

25:39.121 --> 25:40.414
Honestly, I used to think

25:40.998 --> 25:45.627
that had it not been for the car accident,
I'd have ended up with a life like yours.

25:45.711 --> 25:50.132
But even when the damn accident
never happened to me,

25:50.758 --> 25:53.302
I still retired earlier than you.
Isn't that funny?

25:55.262 --> 25:57.681
You've readjusted so well, though.

25:59.892 --> 26:04.188
With my dad's retirement fund
and the money I made as a player,

26:04.271 --> 26:07.566
I put everything into this place.
What choice did I have?

26:07.649 --> 26:09.068
I worked my ass off.

26:09.568 --> 26:13.072
But you know, surprisingly,

26:13.155 --> 26:14.615
I've actually got a knack for it.

26:15.741 --> 26:16.617
What?

26:16.700 --> 26:18.410
It's not just pizza.

26:18.494 --> 26:20.454
Even if I just throw
some veggies together,

26:20.537 --> 26:21.705
it still tastes amazing.

26:22.539 --> 26:26.293
I guess I'm better
with my hands than my feet.

26:28.087 --> 26:29.421
I see.

26:30.089 --> 26:32.382
Then you should've played basketball,
not soccer.

26:32.466 --> 26:33.717
Give me a break.

26:34.968 --> 26:36.970
Just try it before it gets cold.

26:51.693 --> 26:52.778
How is it?

26:54.988 --> 26:57.032
Hey, this is actually good.

26:57.116 --> 26:58.158
Right?

27:10.629 --> 27:12.422
I haven't been here in a while.

27:13.841 --> 27:16.051
Now that I think about it,

27:16.844 --> 27:19.012
I think it was all just lingering regret.

27:19.680 --> 27:23.475
"If only I hadn't hurt my leg,
then I wouldn't be living like this."

27:23.559 --> 27:26.520
Thinking like that
just drove me into a deeper hole.

27:26.603 --> 27:29.189
I kept thinking,
"I'm not meant to be living like this."

27:30.023 --> 27:35.320
And that kept holding me back,
so I couldn't see anything else.

27:43.954 --> 27:45.289
What I'm saying is…

27:47.457 --> 27:49.835
you need to let go too.

27:51.336 --> 27:53.046
Forget about her.

27:53.672 --> 27:55.632
You said that was her last wish.

27:58.302 --> 27:59.761
For me…

28:01.597 --> 28:03.056
it's so strange

28:03.640 --> 28:09.271
that the only people left
who remember Eun-ho are you and me.

28:10.939 --> 28:13.734
But if I really forget Eun-ho,

28:14.359 --> 28:18.071
there'd hardly be anyone left
who remembers her.

28:21.658 --> 28:23.493
You said you bought that house, right?

28:24.703 --> 28:27.706
You know, that building
with my old rooftop apartment.

28:28.332 --> 28:31.001
I heard that neighborhood's
getting redeveloped.

28:31.084 --> 28:35.505
No matter how hard you try,
that building's going to be torn down.

28:35.589 --> 28:37.841
And the whole neighborhood's
going to change.

28:37.925 --> 28:39.927
No matter what you do,

28:40.010 --> 28:43.138
some things are just out of your hands.

28:43.805 --> 28:44.932
I know.

28:48.018 --> 28:49.478
But Woo-seok,

28:49.561 --> 28:52.439
I feel like Eun-ho is out there somewhere.

28:54.775 --> 28:57.569
- Si-yeol--
- I know how crazy this sounds.

28:58.195 --> 29:01.615
But it feels like someone's watching
over me, protecting me.

29:02.241 --> 29:05.327
Like they're right by my side.

29:06.411 --> 29:09.915
They said I was going to die,
but my chart changed out of nowhere.

29:09.998 --> 29:10.874
You remember, right?

29:10.958 --> 29:13.502
That shouldn't have been possible.

29:14.628 --> 29:18.257
And lately, things have been really weird.

29:18.340 --> 29:22.719
When I got injured last year,
they said I'd need six months to recover.

29:22.803 --> 29:24.388
I recovered in just two weeks.

29:24.471 --> 29:26.431
Last month, I definitely left my passport

29:26.515 --> 29:28.934
- and went to the airport--
- Si-yeol.

29:30.644 --> 29:33.188
You need to live your life.

29:33.897 --> 29:36.233
This is no way to live.

29:37.859 --> 29:39.444
It's too painful for you.

29:53.834 --> 29:55.168
NO REDEVELOPMENT WITHOUT CONSENT

29:56.878 --> 29:58.088
CLOSED DUE TO REDEVELOPMENT

30:17.691 --> 30:19.192
I'm hungry.

31:18.251 --> 31:19.544
Eun-ho.

31:40.732 --> 31:42.025
Eun-ho.

31:42.109 --> 31:43.527
You're there, aren't you?

31:44.528 --> 31:45.821
You're really there, right?

31:50.909 --> 31:53.203
I don't know if I've gone crazy or what,

31:54.496 --> 31:56.206
but I still can't believe it.

31:57.416 --> 31:59.501
You disappeared right in front of my eyes…

32:02.045 --> 32:04.714
but it doesn't feel like that was the end.

32:06.341 --> 32:07.759
Even now,

32:09.469 --> 32:11.638
I feel like you're watching me
from somewhere.

32:33.160 --> 32:34.578
Should I check?

32:51.219 --> 32:53.096
What am I doing?

33:39.643 --> 33:41.770
Finally. I thought
I was going to lose my mind.

33:57.786 --> 33:58.787
Eun-ho.

33:58.870 --> 34:00.747
What do you think you're doing?

34:00.830 --> 34:02.874
Were you really going to jump?

34:04.292 --> 34:05.168
How did you…

34:05.252 --> 34:07.504
I told you to forget everything.

34:07.587 --> 34:10.549
What good did knowing me ever do you?
Why are you still like this?

34:11.216 --> 34:13.218
You could've just lived your life.

34:15.011 --> 34:16.555
I can't leave your side…

34:18.640 --> 34:20.934
because you keep acting like this.

35:16.656 --> 35:18.575
Why did you do it?

35:19.200 --> 35:23.163
Heaven is fickle by nature.

35:23.246 --> 35:26.416
Sometimes it's terribly cruel,

35:27.042 --> 35:30.253
but sometimes it's infinitely kind.

35:30.962 --> 35:32.380
Do you trust her?

35:33.590 --> 35:37.969
I heard she's a reckless troublemaker.

35:41.139 --> 35:44.517
I've taught her everything I could.

35:45.602 --> 35:48.104
She'll find her own way now.

35:48.688 --> 35:52.359
To take on her burden
and defy Heaven's will

35:54.027 --> 35:57.322
is to invite a far greater burden
upon yourself.

36:01.409 --> 36:02.535
Even so…

36:04.371 --> 36:07.207
the rain has stopped.

36:15.173 --> 36:17.092
What exactly happened?

36:17.926 --> 36:19.552
I don't really know either.

36:19.636 --> 36:22.222
I don't remember much after vanishing.

36:22.931 --> 36:25.642
It was just raining heavily,

36:26.393 --> 36:28.687
and a long time went by.

36:29.354 --> 36:30.605
My heart felt heavy.

36:31.564 --> 36:34.317
So much so
that I couldn't take a single step.

36:36.695 --> 36:39.155
Next thing I knew, I was back there.

36:39.239 --> 36:41.366
Namsan. Where I faded away.

36:45.203 --> 36:47.622
I don't know what they are thinking,

36:48.373 --> 36:51.876
but it looks like they sent me back
from the River of Three Crossings.

36:54.587 --> 36:55.547
Wait a second.

36:56.840 --> 37:00.301
Then all the strange things
happening around me all this time

37:01.302 --> 37:03.930
really were your doing.

37:05.014 --> 37:06.099
What?

37:08.017 --> 37:11.020
Well, I didn't exactly do all of it.

37:11.104 --> 37:12.814
Some of it was just in your head.

37:12.897 --> 37:14.941
Then when did you get back?

37:16.276 --> 37:17.610
Well…

37:18.528 --> 37:21.281
Like… a year ago.

37:21.364 --> 37:23.366
What? A year?

37:23.450 --> 37:25.577
You've been back for a year
and never showed up?

37:25.660 --> 37:28.288
You just sat and watched me
be a pathetic mess?

37:29.539 --> 37:31.958
Well, you weren't that pathetic.

37:33.376 --> 37:35.879
Winning the last season
unbeaten was really cool.

37:35.962 --> 37:37.672
And that photoshoot last month
came out so--

37:37.756 --> 37:40.049
Didn't you see anything else?

37:42.260 --> 37:44.804
Even when I lifted that trophy…

37:46.681 --> 37:49.559
didn't you see
that I hated myself for being happy?

37:49.642 --> 37:51.603
From eating to sleeping,
every single moment,

37:51.686 --> 37:53.772
didn't you see
that I was barely holding it together?

37:55.690 --> 37:57.525
Didn't you see that I missed you?

37:59.736 --> 38:01.529
I felt like you disappeared
from this world

38:03.072 --> 38:04.824
because of me.

38:06.910 --> 38:09.078
I felt like it was all my fault.

38:09.162 --> 38:12.123
Because saving me
is why you ended up like that,

38:13.333 --> 38:15.794
I tried to live my life
as well as I could.

38:19.506 --> 38:20.840
Why did you do that?

38:21.966 --> 38:23.468
Why did you?

38:26.638 --> 38:27.722
Because I was scared.

38:31.267 --> 38:33.394
I was scared
that loving you would change me.

38:35.021 --> 38:36.272
What?

38:38.107 --> 38:40.944
It's been ten years,
but I remember it like yesterday.

38:44.197 --> 38:47.450
How I felt the moment you were dying.

38:50.286 --> 38:52.247
If I could just save you,

38:53.164 --> 38:56.251
I didn't care what happened to me.

38:57.335 --> 38:59.712
I was fading away,

39:00.338 --> 39:02.799
and you became my whole world.

39:02.882 --> 39:06.094
But that isn't right.

39:06.177 --> 39:08.221
- Eun-ho--
- I want to live as myself.

39:08.304 --> 39:09.472
I want to live as myself,

39:09.556 --> 39:11.975
and even if I die,
I want to die as myself.

39:12.058 --> 39:14.769
If I stay with you, if I love you again,

39:16.271 --> 39:18.314
I'm going to lose myself forever.

39:18.398 --> 39:21.109
Then you shouldn't have cared
if I lived or died.

39:21.192 --> 39:23.152
When I was sick or hurt,

39:23.862 --> 39:25.780
you should've just ignored me.

39:27.115 --> 39:28.575
I'll do that from now on.

39:29.325 --> 39:34.038
I'm going to erase myself from your memory
and never show myself to you again.

39:34.831 --> 39:36.124
Even if you get hurt.

39:37.208 --> 39:40.336
Even if you're sick or dying.

39:44.257 --> 39:46.217
I'm going to look the other way.

39:50.305 --> 39:52.515
This really will be the end for us.

39:58.646 --> 40:01.816
No. You won't do that.

40:02.525 --> 40:04.152
I know you.

40:04.235 --> 40:06.946
If you were okay with erasing my memory,

40:07.030 --> 40:12.160
you would've done it already
because I was in so much pain.

40:12.243 --> 40:13.870
Not for your sake.

40:14.495 --> 40:16.414
You would've erased it for mine.

40:20.418 --> 40:21.920
You promised me once.

40:22.003 --> 40:24.088
That until the very last moment,

40:25.214 --> 40:27.342
you'd try to find
the best solution for both of us.

40:28.551 --> 40:30.053
This is that moment.

40:30.595 --> 40:32.597
Our very last moment.

40:33.264 --> 40:34.724
So tell me.

40:34.807 --> 40:36.851
Is this the best solution you found?

40:36.935 --> 40:40.229
Erasing my memory and living as strangers?

40:40.313 --> 40:43.024
Then what am I supposed to do?

40:43.107 --> 40:46.235
Even if we love each other,
we know how it'll end.

40:46.861 --> 40:49.489
I have no desire to become human again.
Not even a little.

40:49.572 --> 40:52.659
And your time is running out day by day.

40:52.742 --> 40:54.577
In the end, it's goodbye.

40:55.203 --> 40:56.329
Is that so wrong?

40:56.955 --> 41:02.126
If it ends in goodbye,
do the moments we share mean nothing?

41:04.754 --> 41:07.048
You live as yourself,

41:07.131 --> 41:09.175
and I'll keep living as myself too.

41:10.259 --> 41:14.013
I'm human,
so I'll get old and eventually die.

41:14.097 --> 41:16.849
You'll live forever, just as you are now.

41:18.476 --> 41:20.311
So someday,

41:21.562 --> 41:23.398
we'll have a painful goodbye…

41:24.941 --> 41:27.360
but the moments we share

41:27.443 --> 41:29.737
won't be painful for you
when you're left behind.

41:30.363 --> 41:32.073
Because I'll make sure of it.

41:43.001 --> 41:44.335
I told you, didn't I?

41:45.294 --> 41:47.171
I give my all to whatever I decide to do.

41:48.923 --> 41:51.175
I already started ten years ago.

41:52.135 --> 41:53.511
And it's not over yet.

41:55.430 --> 41:56.639
So…

41:59.350 --> 42:00.852
don't run away.

42:41.309 --> 42:42.977
Did I overdo it?

42:50.401 --> 42:52.278
This isn't it either.

43:09.545 --> 43:11.589
Why don't I have anything to wear?

43:11.672 --> 43:15.593
I don't know what to wear
on our first date in ten years.

43:20.389 --> 43:21.557
Eun-ho.

43:24.519 --> 43:25.645
Have you been waiting long?

43:26.437 --> 43:28.106
I wanted to get here before you.

43:28.189 --> 43:29.690
No, I just got here.

43:33.277 --> 43:34.612
Here.

43:34.695 --> 43:38.950
I realized I've never actually
given you flowers before.

43:41.410 --> 43:42.370
Whoa.

43:48.459 --> 43:49.710
Oh man.

43:50.211 --> 43:52.839
How did a reporter find us already?

43:53.464 --> 43:55.424
Eun-ho, let's go somewhere quieter--

43:55.508 --> 43:58.886
Oh, he's not a reporter.
He's a photographer I hired.

44:00.805 --> 44:01.806
What?

44:01.889 --> 44:04.058
We only ever took one photo together.

44:04.142 --> 44:06.519
Even that vanished
when your fate switched back.

44:07.103 --> 44:08.688
That's always bothered me.

44:10.148 --> 44:11.858
But what's that got to do with…

44:13.025 --> 44:15.403
A long time from now,

44:16.154 --> 44:18.614
I'll need at least one more thing
to remember you by.

44:23.953 --> 44:28.666
Besides, I heard kids these days
take a lot of date photos.

44:28.749 --> 44:30.710
We just need to go on our date,

44:31.544 --> 44:34.046
and they'll capture our memories for us.

44:35.882 --> 44:39.677
But how can we have a date?
It's too awkward.

44:39.760 --> 44:41.053
Don't worry about it.

44:42.263 --> 44:45.266
I put a spell on them,
so they won't remember a thing.

44:45.349 --> 44:46.684
So we

44:47.310 --> 44:49.228
can even kiss if we want.

44:51.856 --> 44:52.899
What?

44:52.982 --> 44:55.318
Oh, right. We should at least
say hi to the photographer.

44:55.401 --> 44:56.944
You guys have met, right?

44:57.028 --> 44:58.237
Hey, you. Photographer!

44:59.405 --> 45:01.782
Hi, Si-yeol! Long time no see.

45:01.866 --> 45:04.076
Mr. Oh! How did you--

45:04.160 --> 45:05.536
I just loved

45:05.620 --> 45:07.496
how that photoshoot
you did last month came out.

45:07.580 --> 45:10.124
So I specifically hired him
for our couple shoot.

45:10.958 --> 45:12.543
Wait…

45:12.627 --> 45:15.588
Mr. Oh is shooting our date photos?

45:15.671 --> 45:17.423
But he's the top photographer
in his field.

45:20.301 --> 45:21.552
What's this for?

45:21.636 --> 45:24.513
I called a filming crew too.

45:25.181 --> 45:27.642
Photos are nice,
but video captures the vibe differently.

45:28.309 --> 45:30.269
From now on, every moment of our dates

45:30.353 --> 45:32.521
will be recorded
by the best staff in the industry.

45:32.605 --> 45:35.524
Jeez, is all this really necessary?

45:35.608 --> 45:38.152
Say hi to the director too.
You'll be seeing him a lot.

45:39.487 --> 45:41.072
- Director!
- Yes!

45:41.572 --> 45:44.158
Hello there, Mr. Kang!

45:44.242 --> 45:45.826
Hello.

45:45.910 --> 45:48.871
He went to Cannes and won an Oscar too.

45:49.580 --> 45:51.415
I thought he'd be good
at filming our dates,

45:51.499 --> 45:52.792
so I booked him specifically.

45:52.875 --> 45:55.127
Since we can't really see your face,

45:55.211 --> 45:57.004
why don't you take off the mask?

45:57.088 --> 45:59.548
Right. Of course, Director.

45:59.632 --> 46:00.925
Cameras are rolling.

46:01.008 --> 46:02.927
See? He knows his stuff.

46:03.594 --> 46:04.595
Let's go.

46:13.020 --> 46:14.063
Eun-ho.

46:26.534 --> 46:28.869
Mm! This is good.

46:50.182 --> 46:52.018
Hold on. Wait.

46:52.810 --> 46:55.980
The background is great here.
Could you two stand right there?

46:56.063 --> 46:58.816
Really? You think it's a good photo spot?

46:58.899 --> 47:00.526
Great!

47:00.609 --> 47:02.737
Si-yeol, big smile!

47:03.738 --> 47:05.323
Make it look natural!

47:07.992 --> 47:10.244
Could you give me a different pose?

47:10.745 --> 47:11.787
A different pose?

47:13.205 --> 47:14.540
Maybe try a kiss or something.

47:15.249 --> 47:17.460
But there are too many people here.

47:18.127 --> 47:19.754
No one will remember.

47:19.837 --> 47:21.964
I'll make sure
there isn't any press coverage.

47:23.132 --> 47:24.133
Here.

47:31.098 --> 47:33.225
Okay, that was great.

47:42.693 --> 47:44.862
Today was so much fun, wasn't it?

47:45.654 --> 47:46.572
Yeah.

47:47.782 --> 47:50.993
Hold on, let me fix your hair.

47:51.077 --> 47:52.328
Okay.

47:55.206 --> 47:57.041
What should we do now?

47:57.124 --> 47:58.709
Well…

48:00.044 --> 48:01.295
I was thinking

48:02.213 --> 48:04.882
maybe we should go somewhere
without all these people.

48:07.301 --> 48:08.719
What?

48:09.261 --> 48:12.390
We've got plenty of photos and videos,
so I just want to be alone with you.

48:13.057 --> 48:14.809
Just the two of us?

48:18.938 --> 48:20.231
In that case,

48:22.274 --> 48:24.110
do you want to go to my place?

48:25.694 --> 48:26.946
What?

48:42.503 --> 48:43.587
Come on in.

48:47.049 --> 48:51.011
Wow. So this really is North Korea.

48:51.637 --> 48:53.347
I didn't know that last time I was here.

48:54.598 --> 48:56.559
Well, it is Myohyangsan Mountain.

48:59.228 --> 49:01.522
Man, I haven't been here in ages.

49:02.148 --> 49:03.816
I came here once, ten years ago.

49:11.240 --> 49:14.952
So you lived in this huge place
all by yourself?

49:15.619 --> 49:16.662
All that time?

49:21.250 --> 49:22.334
Yeah.

49:22.960 --> 49:23.878
I suppose.

49:34.138 --> 49:35.181
What's this?

49:36.724 --> 49:37.808
It's just

49:38.559 --> 49:40.311
that I figured you must've been lonely.

49:51.197 --> 49:52.490
Hey, you're home.

49:55.493 --> 49:56.368
Hey!

49:56.452 --> 49:59.413
Why are you in my house
when I wasn't even home?

49:59.497 --> 50:01.165
Wow, that hurts.

50:01.665 --> 50:02.791
Long time no see.

50:02.875 --> 50:05.753
Yeah, long time no see.

50:07.630 --> 50:12.718
For some reason,
I feel like your whole vibe has changed.

50:12.801 --> 50:15.304
Right, she became a nine-tailed fox too.

50:15.387 --> 50:16.347
That day, ten years ago.

50:17.515 --> 50:19.517
When she sacrificed herself for you,

50:19.600 --> 50:21.560
my fox bead accumulated
tons of spiritual power.

50:22.770 --> 50:24.063
I see.

50:28.567 --> 50:31.028
By the way, no need to thank me.

50:31.820 --> 50:32.696
Excuse me?

50:32.780 --> 50:36.033
I'm the one who cured you, Si-yeol.

50:36.825 --> 50:38.327
Hey!

50:40.162 --> 50:42.331
What? He deserves to know.

50:43.249 --> 50:45.626
Ten years ago, she asked me for a favor

50:45.709 --> 50:49.129
when she said she was hiding
my fox bead because of those creeps.

50:50.798 --> 50:53.509
If I end up disappearing from this world

50:54.051 --> 50:58.097
and can no longer protect Si-yeol…

50:59.306 --> 51:00.182
What?

51:01.767 --> 51:03.269
If that day comes,

51:04.436 --> 51:05.896
I need you to step in

51:07.064 --> 51:09.233
and save Si-yeol for me.

51:12.278 --> 51:15.656
I'd just become a nine-tailed fox,
so I was low on spiritual power.

51:15.739 --> 51:18.450
So I had to use every bit
of spiritual power I had

51:18.534 --> 51:20.828
to save you from dying
of that heart condition.

51:20.911 --> 51:23.163
I suffered for years because of that.

51:24.206 --> 51:26.125
Are you seriously not going to go home?

51:26.208 --> 51:28.294
Stop coming over here already!

51:29.378 --> 51:32.381
All this time, you've been hugging me,

51:32.464 --> 51:35.801
sobbing your eyes out,
all because you missed Si-yeol.

51:35.884 --> 51:38.178
And now you're saying
you don't need me anymore?

51:38.721 --> 51:39.763
Your house is huge too.

51:39.847 --> 51:41.181
I swear…

51:41.265 --> 51:43.976
Will you please shut up?

51:44.518 --> 51:45.894
Look at her!

51:49.481 --> 51:50.482
I don't want it.

51:57.448 --> 51:59.908
Gosh, I barely got rid of her.

52:01.410 --> 52:04.997
Since she grew another tail,
she's turned into such a sly fox.

52:05.080 --> 52:07.374
I seriously can't handle her anymore.

52:08.042 --> 52:09.251
Really?

52:09.335 --> 52:11.879
I was actually really glad to see her.

52:12.546 --> 52:14.256
It brought back some old memories.

52:14.340 --> 52:18.010
You should be careful if you think
she's anything like she was before.

52:18.093 --> 52:21.597
I think her temper
is even worse than mine.

52:22.222 --> 52:23.349
No way.

52:23.974 --> 52:25.392
That's impossible.

52:25.476 --> 52:26.810
I'm serious.

52:27.436 --> 52:30.397
It wasn't only you and Woo-seok
whose lives were restored ten years ago.

52:31.148 --> 52:33.776
Because of me, that male shaman,
Jang Do-cheol or whatever,

52:33.859 --> 52:37.613
was practically a walking corpse
because of the spiritual backlash.

52:37.696 --> 52:39.281
But he came back to life as well.

52:53.087 --> 52:55.839
I guess since he had some spiritual power,

52:55.923 --> 52:59.134
he seemed to have woken up
remembering what happened.

52:59.218 --> 53:00.386
So?

53:00.469 --> 53:04.723
He should've seen it as a second chance
and kept his head down,

53:04.807 --> 53:07.184
but he went after the fox bead again.

53:07.267 --> 53:08.769
Reckless fool.

53:35.504 --> 53:39.174
He went to Seoraksan Mountain,
looking for an easy eight-tailed fox,

53:40.175 --> 53:42.845
but he ran into a pissed-off
nine-tailed fox instead.

53:43.971 --> 53:47.891
So he met the same wretched end
as in his previous life.

53:49.268 --> 53:50.894
I see.

53:51.729 --> 53:52.771
Oh, right.

53:53.564 --> 53:57.609
Then what happened to Lee Yoon,
the guy who shot me?

53:58.485 --> 54:00.988
I saw on the news that he's in prison.

54:01.071 --> 54:03.157
Did she do that too?

54:03.741 --> 54:06.410
- No, Geum-ho didn't do that.
- Hey, get off me!

54:06.493 --> 54:08.162
He brought it on himself.

54:08.245 --> 54:10.247
We know exactly who you are.
That's why we're here.

54:10.330 --> 54:11.874
Let's go quietly.

54:12.541 --> 54:13.667
Damn it!

54:13.751 --> 54:16.211
Neither Geum-ho nor I did a single thing.

54:16.295 --> 54:18.839
He managed to land himself
in prison all on his own.

54:22.718 --> 54:24.928
But… "Geum-ho"?

54:25.888 --> 54:28.182
Yeah, she grew another tail.

54:28.265 --> 54:31.518
So I gave her a name since it was awkward
to keep calling her an eight-tailed fox.

54:32.519 --> 54:34.897
You can call her Geum-ho too.

54:37.065 --> 54:39.067
Anyway, let's talk about you now.

54:39.651 --> 54:42.696
Have you thought
about what you'll do after retirement?

54:44.531 --> 54:45.532
Yeah.

54:46.617 --> 54:48.994
I've done enough as a player,

54:49.536 --> 54:52.414
so I'm thinking
of being a club owner for a while.

54:52.498 --> 54:53.665
For real.

54:54.333 --> 54:55.209
Club owner?

54:56.084 --> 54:57.211
Actually,

54:58.253 --> 55:00.589
I bought a team ten years ago.

55:02.883 --> 55:03.759
Man.

55:04.551 --> 55:06.762
Coach, the game's about to start.

55:06.845 --> 55:08.847
What's this really important announcement?

55:08.931 --> 55:10.224
What is it?

55:10.307 --> 55:12.893
Why keep us in suspense
without saying anything?

55:12.976 --> 55:15.103
Hey, just wait a bit, will you?

55:22.569 --> 55:24.655
- What the…
- Oh gosh.

55:25.531 --> 55:26.490
Jeez.

55:26.573 --> 55:27.574
- Hey!
- Excuse me.

55:27.658 --> 55:30.410
- Outsiders can't just walk in here--
- Chi-su, wait!

55:30.494 --> 55:33.163
That's… Kang…

55:33.247 --> 55:34.957
- Kang…
- What are you saying?

55:35.040 --> 55:37.000
Whoa!

55:37.084 --> 55:39.962
Kang… Si-yeol?

55:40.504 --> 55:44.925
Let's hear it for the player,
Kang Si-yeol, who just acquired our team…

55:45.008 --> 55:45.884
No, wait.

55:45.968 --> 55:48.929
Let's hear it
for our club owner, Kang Si-yeol!

55:53.934 --> 55:55.686
Wait…

55:56.228 --> 55:59.231
So… Mr. Kang Si-yeol,

55:59.314 --> 56:01.608
- No way.
- I'm such a huge fan.

56:01.692 --> 56:04.736
And you're my… role model.

56:05.612 --> 56:06.738
Is that right?

56:06.822 --> 56:10.450
I had no idea you thought of me
like that, Seo Beom.

56:11.076 --> 56:12.286
What?

56:12.369 --> 56:13.662
Oh my gosh.

56:13.745 --> 56:15.664
How do you know my name?

56:16.832 --> 56:17.833
Of course I know it.

56:19.126 --> 56:20.627
We're on the same team now.

56:21.670 --> 56:24.631
So, how are they all doing these days?

56:25.132 --> 56:26.133
Well,

56:26.216 --> 56:29.136
Beom is still working with the team.

56:29.219 --> 56:30.804
He's our GM.

56:31.680 --> 56:33.390
You know how he's sharp with numbers.

56:33.891 --> 56:36.184
I think he's better at this
than he was as a player.

56:38.228 --> 56:39.563
And?

56:40.188 --> 56:43.567
Gyeong-hun finally snagged
the starting keeper spot,

56:43.650 --> 56:47.321
Jeong-bae retired early
and took over his family's restaurant.

56:48.030 --> 56:50.782
Yeah, their galbi is pretty good.

56:51.408 --> 56:56.079
As for Chi-su, he transferred out
and went up to the second division.

56:56.163 --> 56:57.998
And now he's playing in the K League.

56:58.999 --> 57:00.417
He even made the national team.

57:01.084 --> 57:04.588
Well, he was a surprise pick
and only played one game.

57:05.422 --> 57:06.840
That's impressive.

57:10.844 --> 57:12.804
It'd be nice to see them sometime,

57:12.888 --> 57:14.973
though they probably
won't even remember me.

57:17.184 --> 57:19.853
Let's grab a meal together soon.

57:20.854 --> 57:21.855
Okay.

57:50.926 --> 57:52.427
He must've been really tired.

58:18.495 --> 58:22.290
RIP KANG SI-YEOL
JUNE 10, 1998 - MARCH 20, 2096

58:22.374 --> 58:23.500
Eun-ho.

58:26.420 --> 58:27.713
What's wrong?

58:29.339 --> 58:31.508
No… it's nothing.

58:32.342 --> 58:35.012
I think I just saw our distant future.

58:36.596 --> 58:37.889
Is it a bad future?

58:39.516 --> 58:42.894
Not really, just a little sad.

58:46.148 --> 58:47.691
Don't worry too much.

58:47.774 --> 58:50.027
I decided I won't be shaken up
by things like this anymore.

58:50.694 --> 58:52.571
Like I told you before,

58:52.654 --> 58:54.948
I saw the future when I first met you.

58:55.699 --> 58:57.576
At first, I saw your friend succeed,

58:57.659 --> 59:00.287
then in the same future,
it was you who succeeded.

59:02.539 --> 59:03.498
Back then,

59:04.291 --> 59:06.418
I thought maybe I just saw it wrong,

59:06.501 --> 59:08.628
and I brushed it off as nothing.

59:09.588 --> 59:12.382
But thinking back
after everything we've been through…

59:14.801 --> 59:17.304
it was a future that actually happened.

59:18.930 --> 59:20.807
Because I intervened in your fate

59:21.433 --> 59:24.478
and briefly switched
your fate with your friend's.

59:28.482 --> 59:31.985
So from the moment we met 19 years ago,

59:33.487 --> 59:36.198
it was our fate to end up like this.

59:37.866 --> 59:39.034
Yeah.

59:44.289 --> 59:46.666
Then this sad future you just saw

59:47.584 --> 59:49.753
is going to happen eventually, right?

59:50.378 --> 59:52.964
And you're really okay with that?

59:59.096 --> 01:00:00.430
I'm okay.

01:00:01.098 --> 01:00:03.850
Just because I know
a moment in the future

01:00:03.934 --> 01:00:06.103
and can guess the outcome,

01:00:06.186 --> 01:00:09.523
I've learned that it doesn't mean
I know the process or the meaning.

01:00:10.857 --> 01:00:15.695
So in our love, and in our lives,
no matter what ending comes,

01:00:17.197 --> 01:00:18.740
I'm just going to face it.

01:00:20.575 --> 01:00:24.913
I'll only know
what that ending really means to me

01:00:24.996 --> 01:00:28.542
after I've lived through it all.

01:00:54.067 --> 01:00:55.360
What do you think?

01:00:56.570 --> 01:00:57.487
It's nice.

01:00:57.571 --> 01:01:00.031
Just the two of us on a deserted island.

01:01:00.115 --> 01:01:01.116
It's kind of romantic.

01:01:02.784 --> 01:01:03.952
Right?

01:01:05.370 --> 01:01:07.414
I'm building a two-story house over there,

01:01:07.497 --> 01:01:09.166
but I'm currently revising
the floor plans.

01:01:09.249 --> 01:01:11.376
It was supposed to be a villa just for me,

01:01:11.459 --> 01:01:13.211
but since we're going to live
together now,

01:01:13.295 --> 01:01:15.130
the layout ended up changing a lot.

01:01:15.213 --> 01:01:17.465
Oh, over there?

01:01:18.800 --> 01:01:20.177
Can we go see it now?

01:01:20.260 --> 01:01:21.386
Of course.

01:01:24.097 --> 01:01:25.432
Let's go.

01:01:29.978 --> 01:01:32.272
If there's anything you need,
just let me know.

01:01:32.355 --> 01:01:33.982
I'll make sure to include it.

01:01:34.733 --> 01:01:37.861
Well, from what I heard,
it sounds like we're all set.

01:01:39.404 --> 01:01:40.614
Besides,

01:01:41.698 --> 01:01:43.658
I just need you by my side.

01:01:45.660 --> 01:01:47.078
Stop it.

01:01:49.039 --> 01:01:53.001
By the way, where's the dock going to be?

01:01:53.793 --> 01:01:54.753
What?

01:01:55.337 --> 01:01:56.838
The dock.

01:01:56.922 --> 01:01:58.381
For the boats to come and go.

01:01:59.799 --> 01:02:01.009
Why do we need that?

01:02:02.260 --> 01:02:04.971
You can just hold my hand
to come and go like this.

01:02:05.055 --> 01:02:06.806
It's way faster and easier.

01:02:07.474 --> 01:02:08.850
No, but still…

01:02:10.018 --> 01:02:11.728
What do I do when you're not here?

01:02:11.811 --> 01:02:14.314
Call me. Just burn the business card.

01:02:14.397 --> 01:02:16.650
Oh, about that…

01:02:17.234 --> 01:02:18.568
How should I put it?

01:02:19.277 --> 01:02:21.821
I know it probably won't happen often,

01:02:21.905 --> 01:02:24.074
but what if we get into a fight,

01:02:24.157 --> 01:02:28.328
or what if you get mad at me?
Anything could happen.

01:02:28.411 --> 01:02:31.623
Then am I stuck on the island
until you cool off?

01:02:32.249 --> 01:02:33.250
Of course.

01:02:33.333 --> 01:02:36.294
Did you think dating a nine-tailed fox
was going to be that easy?

01:02:38.255 --> 01:02:39.422
What?

01:02:42.342 --> 01:02:43.385
I'm kidding.

01:02:44.052 --> 01:02:46.429
I'm going to build the dock over there.

01:02:47.305 --> 01:02:49.516
I already ordered a yacht too.

01:02:51.226 --> 01:02:53.228
Oh, I see.

01:02:53.937 --> 01:02:55.021
That's a relief.

01:02:56.982 --> 01:02:59.985
You look genuinely relieved right now.

01:03:00.986 --> 01:03:03.571
No, I don't. Not at all.

01:03:04.322 --> 01:03:05.282
Don't worry.

01:03:05.365 --> 01:03:07.617
Having a boat doesn't mean
I can't keep you here.

01:03:07.701 --> 01:03:09.786
Oh, come on, stop it.

01:03:09.869 --> 01:03:11.579
That actually scares me.

01:03:12.539 --> 01:03:15.000
Then just treat me right,
and you'll be fine.

01:03:18.086 --> 01:03:19.671
This is nice.

01:03:20.463 --> 01:03:23.717
I feel like we've got nothing
but happiness ahead.

01:03:23.800 --> 01:03:24.759
Don't you?

01:03:26.303 --> 01:03:28.888
Yeah. I'll be good to you.

01:03:38.273 --> 01:03:39.357
This is nice.

01:03:54.956 --> 01:03:57.417
SPECIAL APPEARANCES BY JUNG DONG-HWAN
WOO HYEON AND HONG SU-HYEON

01:04:21.358 --> 01:04:24.486
NO TAIL TO TELL

01:05:01.189 --> 01:05:03.191
Subtitle translation by Susanna Kim
